keywords:
  - femtosecond laser writing
  - optical waveguides
  - fused silica
  - beam propagation method
  - coupled-mode theory
  - reproducible research
abstract: >-
  Numerical research on a passive optical network written with femtosecond
  laser inside fused silica. The repository contains CPU models, bounded
  CUDA tests, retained negative results and their audits. No fabricated
  device, measured optical system or validated neural network is claimed.
